WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.850
Today's words use four more sounds. Here they are.

2
00:00:07.101 --> 00:00:09.166
The last two letters make the same sound.

3
00:00:09.616 --> 00:00:16.446
Point to each tile on the page and ask for its sound. If your child does not know one, tell them once, and move on.

4
00:00:16.896 --> 00:00:19.239
Then they read the words. Here are two of them.

5
00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:23.544
The word is dog.

6
00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:28.085
The word is cat.

7
00:00:28.985 --> 00:00:32.175
Last, your child matches four of the words to their pictures.
